{
  "id": "arthur_crane_final",
  "start_node": "confrontation_01",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "confrontation_01",
      "speaker": "Edmund",
      "text": "You received her letter, Arthur. Three weeks before she died. She told you about Hargrove and you buried it.",
      "portrait": "edmund",
      "next": "arthur_pause"
    },
    {
      "id": "arthur_pause",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "...",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "arthur_sits"
    },
    {
      "id": "arthur_sits",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "Close the door, Edmund.",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "arthur_confession_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "arthur_confession_01",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "Hargrove funds thirty percent of our printing contracts. Do you understand what that means? The paper. The jobs. Everyone here.",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "arthur_confession_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "arthur_confession_02",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "I went to her. I asked her to stop. I explained what was at stake. She said that people were dying in those buildings and she didn't care about printing contracts.",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "arthur_confession_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "arthur_confession_03",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "She was right, of course. She was always right about those things. That was Clara.",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "edmund_reaction"
    },
    {
      "id": "edmund_reaction",
      "speaker": "Edmund",
      "text": "You killed her.",
      "portrait": "edmund",
      "next": "arthur_confession_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "arthur_confession_04",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "I protected what I'd built. What we'd built. You, Edmund — fifteen years. I taught you this trade.",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "arthur_confession_05"
    },
    {
      "id": "arthur_confession_05",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "I didn't want it to be this way. I want you to believe that.",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "final_choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "final_choice",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "portrait": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "[BRIGHT] I'm going to the police. And then I'm going to every paper in London with your name on the front page.",
          "lantern": 2,
          "next": "ending_bright",
          "set_flags": [{ "name": "ending", "value": "bright" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "[DIM] You're going to confess. Publicly. Or I print everything — including what this says about you.",
          "lantern": 0,
          "next": "ending_mid",
          "set_flags": [{ "name": "ending", "value": "mid" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "[DARK] Stand up.",
          "lantern": -3,
          "next": "ending_dark",
          "set_flags": [{ "name": "ending", "value": "dark" }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_bright",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "You'll destroy the paper.",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "ending_bright_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_bright_02",
      "speaker": "Edmund",
      "text": "Good.",
      "portrait": "edmund",
      "next": "end"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_mid",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "...You've become harder than I remember.",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "ending_mid_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_mid_02",
      "speaker": "Edmund",
      "text": "You did that.",
      "portrait": "edmund",
      "next": "end"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_dark",
      "speaker": "Arthur Crane",
      "text": "Edmund. Think about what you're—",
      "portrait": "arthur",
      "next": "ending_dark_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_dark_02",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "The lantern goes out.",
      "portrait": "",
      "next": "end"
    }
  ]
}
